        <ideoName>Guidance of the Creator</ideoName>
        <ideoDescription>Ever since Makainian has reached the Primordial Forge, they feel the urge to explore even further beyond their own domain.

Makainian are split into several factions, each governed by a immortal guardian. These guardians are a manifestation of a concept that has existed ever since the dawn of Makai creation, directly guiding Makainian through the path of evolution.

From the era of the first dawn to the pinnacle of the primordial forge era. with the arrival of Primordial Forge, Makainian goal is to spread the greatness to outside the domain, wielding the power of the first flame, to other un-ascended domain the power of primordial forge is an irresistible temptation, this has allow Makainian "tourist" to have free and unhindered access to other domain through permission of other domain creator. </ideoDescription>
